## Fabric Workflow

Follow this systematic workflow for all features:

### 1. Shape Spec
Reference: @.cursor/prompts/shape-spec.md
- Gather requirements through strategic questions
- Create initial spec outline
- Identify edge cases and acceptance criteria

### 2. Write Spec
Reference: @.cursor/prompts/write-spec.md
- Write detailed specification
- Define acceptance criteria
- Document edge cases

### 3. Create Tasks
Reference: @.cursor/prompts/create-tasks.md
- Break spec into task groups
- Define implementation order
- Estimate effort

### 4. Implement
Reference: @.cursor/prompts/implement-tasks.md
- Follow TDD approach
- Implement tasks systematically
- Update progress in tasks.md

### 5. Verify
Reference: @.cursor/prompts/3-verify-implementation.md
- Verify all acceptance criteria met
- Run full test suite
- Generate verification report

